<title>FRANCE: Alcatel/Dassault news conference postponed.</title>
<headline>Alcatel/Dassault news conference postponed.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>A news conference scheduled for Tuesday by Alcatel Alsthom and Dassault Industrie on a joint bid for the state's 58-percent stake in Thomson-CSF has been postponed, Alcatel said.</p>
<p>A spokeswoman said that there were no difficulties with the companies' bid but the groups had judged it better to postpone the conference to a later date.</p>
<p>She declined comment on industry suggestions the conference was postponed due to the uncertain political climate of the moment amid rumours of a government reshuffle or a snap election.</p>
</text>
